1
00:00:23,719 --> 00:00:26,280
Hello, I'm from Chef's Restaurant.

2
00:00:26,679 --> 00:00:27,480
Dad!

3
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:28,640
Xiao Yu!

4
00:00:29,839 --> 00:00:30,679
Are you having fun?

5
00:00:30,679 --> 00:00:31,480
Yes, I am!

6
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:34,399
Who are you?

7
00:00:34,719 --> 00:00:36,359
I'm here to deliver your cake.

8
00:00:36,719 --> 00:00:37,520
Thank you.

9
00:00:37,759 --> 00:00:38,479
Here's the cake. You're welcome.

10
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:39,280
Go inside and eat.

11
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:43,280
Is there anything else?

12
00:00:44,399 --> 00:00:45,520
Is this your son?

13
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:46,200
What about it?

14
00:00:46,799 --> 00:00:48,399
Nothing. He's really cute.

15
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:55,320
Xiao Yu, catch!

16
00:01:01,039 --> 00:01:01,759
Luo Qian.

17
00:01:04,640 --> 00:01:06,000
My dear classmates,

18
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:07,760
it's been a while.

19
00:01:08,760 --> 00:01:10,120
Seeing you all again

20
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:14,200
feels both familiar and foreign.

21
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:16,359
Successful careers,

22
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:18,680
surrounded by friends,

23
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,519
married with kids...

24
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:24,959
You've all become winners in life.

25
00:01:26,159 --> 00:01:29,920
Completely different from who you used to be.

26
00:02:59,919 --> 00:03:01,360
But to my relief,

27
00:03:02,199 --> 00:03:04,319
as I dug deeper into your lives,

28
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:07,599
I found you're exactly the same as before.

29
00:03:08,599 --> 00:03:09,840
You haven't changed a bit.

30
00:03:11,719 --> 00:03:13,680
Affairs, cheating...

31
00:03:14,599 --> 00:03:15,719
Gathering evidence of this

32
00:03:15,719 --> 00:03:17,400
was incredibly easy.

33
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:19,960
But this alone wasn't enough,

34
00:03:20,719 --> 00:03:23,240
because you were already so used to it.

35
00:03:23,879 --> 00:03:26,319
I needed to pry into deeper secrets.

36
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:29,000
Fortunately, secrets have legs.

37
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:31,719
They walked right up to me.

38
00:03:53,039 --> 00:03:54,080
Get in the car first, Qianqian.

39
00:03:54,919 --> 00:03:55,919
I'll take care of this.

40
00:04:04,919 --> 00:04:05,520
Get in.

41
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:09,639
You're riding too slow.

42
00:05:58,040 --> 00:05:59,519
Qianqian! Qianqian!

43
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:02,600
Qianqian! Qianqian!

44
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:04,319
Qianqian, can you hear me?

45
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:06,399
Qianqian!

46
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,040
Qianqian!

47
00:06:09,399 --> 00:06:10,120
Qianqian!

48
00:06:23,879 --> 00:06:24,959
Here, here, here!

49
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:58,480
I'm here. I'm here.

50
00:06:59,439 --> 00:07:00,240
Where are you guys?

51
00:07:00,839 --> 00:07:01,439
Yeah, okay.

52
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:18,120
Because of love, we don't easily feel sad

53
00:07:18,519 --> 00:07:23,399
So everything looks like happiness

54
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:26,360
Because of love

55
00:07:27,399 --> 00:07:28,319
How's the Principal's singing?

56
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:52,879
New here?

57
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:02,399
You're the Principal of Lide Elementary School, right?

58
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:05,720
No, I'm not. Who are you?

59
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:11,240
I brought a little toy.

60
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:12,480
A little toy?

61
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:17,160
What is this?

62
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,279
A flash drive.

63
00:08:20,319 --> 00:08:21,720
These are the videos and photos

64
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:24,360
from every time you came here to play.

65
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:29,240
Principal, I have to say...

66
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:32,759
some of the footage is pretty wild.

67
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:34,360
You really know how to have fun.

68
00:08:36,039 --> 00:08:36,799
What do you mean?

69
00:08:38,559 --> 00:08:39,480
Are you threatening me?

70
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:41,279
What are you doing?

71
00:08:42,799 --> 00:08:43,879
What are you doing?!

72
00:08:47,399 --> 00:08:48,840
Come on, you didn't really think

73
00:08:49,159 --> 00:08:51,120
I only had one backup, did you?

74
00:08:54,919 --> 00:08:55,919
What do you want?

75
00:09:01,879 --> 00:09:02,720
What did you say?

76
00:09:05,679 --> 00:09:07,120
What do you want?

77
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:15,200
I want

78
00:09:19,159 --> 00:09:20,360
to make a deal with you.

79
00:09:23,679 --> 00:09:24,480
I looked into them.

80
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,360
Their qualifications are fine.

81
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:26,799
But...

82
00:09:27,279 --> 00:09:28,080
But what?

83
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:29,960
They haven't been established for long.

84
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:31,120
They don't seem very experienced.

85
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:32,279
If we're really hosting a summer camp,

86
00:09:32,279 --> 00:09:34,559
shouldn't we consider other partners?

87
00:09:35,559 --> 00:09:37,120
Don't worry about that.

88
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:40,159
Just go handle the specific procedures.

89
00:09:40,679 --> 00:09:41,559
Alright, understood.

90
00:09:49,159 --> 00:09:50,720
The Dean of Academic Affairs will contact you shortly.

91
00:09:50,919 --> 00:09:52,039
Once you get the funds,

92
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:53,799
you can give the flash drive back to me, right?

93
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:01,279
Old classmates.

94
00:10:03,799 --> 00:10:05,240
Do you still remember me?

95
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:11,879
Welcome to our reunion.

96
00:10:17,759 --> 00:10:20,159
Today, the kids are playing Hide-and-Seek.

97
00:10:20,919 --> 00:10:22,919
They're all hidden.

98
00:10:23,919 --> 00:10:25,080
Go find them.

99
00:10:25,919 --> 00:10:27,360
Don't be a buzzkill.

100
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:30,240
Xiaochen!

101
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:36,120
They're already hiding.

102
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:38,919
Go find them! Go on!

103
00:10:39,559 --> 00:10:41,440
I don't really remember you, actually.

104
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:44,240
Is there some bad blood between us?

105
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:52,480
I'm just a little curious.

106
00:10:54,879 --> 00:10:59,759
Why did you bully me so ruthlessly back then?

107
00:11:05,320 --> 00:11:06,720
You were different from us.

108
00:11:08,639 --> 00:11:09,320
You see,

109
00:11:11,679 --> 00:11:13,200
you do remember me.

110
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:16,080
Can you just tell me where the kids are?

111
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:17,679
You haven't answered my question.

112
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:23,440
How was I

113
00:11:25,559 --> 00:11:26,639
different from you?

114
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:31,360
It's all in the past.

115
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:35,200
We were young. Everyone did stupid things.

116
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:38,360
We just thought it was fun.

117
00:11:40,919 --> 00:11:41,879
Fun?

118
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:51,120
Bringing pain to others...

119
00:11:52,399 --> 00:11:54,639
Why would you find that fun?

120
00:11:58,919 --> 00:11:59,600
I...

121
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:03,480
If your kids

122
00:12:04,080 --> 00:12:05,200
were also abused

123
00:12:06,279 --> 00:12:07,279
and beaten,

124
00:12:08,799 --> 00:12:10,240
would you think that's fun too?

125
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:12,120
Where did you hide the kids?

126
00:12:13,720 --> 00:12:15,200
Even if there's bad blood between us,

127
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:16,240
that's between us adults.

128
00:12:16,240 --> 00:12:17,240
It has nothing to do with the kids.

129
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:20,480
What does it have to do with you?

130
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:25,600
Is your kid in there by any chance?

131
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:29,720
No matter whose kids they are,

132
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:32,000
you should at least have some basic decency.

133
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:34,600
Why didn't you realize that back then?

134
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:45,240
Has it been too long?

135
00:12:46,519 --> 00:12:48,080
Forgot how to talk to us?

136
00:12:48,399 --> 00:12:49,720
I'm talking to you.

137
00:12:50,799 --> 00:12:52,120
I know how to speak.

138
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:53,960
What's your name?

139
00:12:54,639 --> 00:12:56,120
My name is Lin Yajing.

140
00:12:56,360 --> 00:12:57,240
What's my name?

141
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:00,879
Ow, it hurts!

142
00:13:01,279 --> 00:13:02,679
Your name is Luo Qian.

143
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:03,720
What about me?

144
00:13:05,720 --> 00:13:07,120
I'll give you a hint.

145
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:08,639
Zhou.

146
00:13:09,480 --> 00:13:10,480
Zhou Wenqiang.

147
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:12,360
Zhou Wenqiang.

148
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:14,120
Zhou Wenqiang.

149
00:13:14,120 --> 00:13:15,080
Zhou Wenqiang.

150
00:13:15,519 --> 00:13:16,440
Zhou Wenqiang.

151
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:17,360
He changed his name.

152
00:13:18,720 --> 00:13:19,759
Wrong name.

153
00:13:19,759 --> 00:13:21,399
His name is Zhou Minglei.

154
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:22,559
Got it?

155
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:23,360
Say it again.

156
00:13:23,840 --> 00:13:25,120
Zhou Minglei.

157
00:13:25,360 --> 00:13:26,360
Wh-What's my name?

158
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:27,159
What's my name?

159
00:13:27,759 --> 00:13:28,559
What's my name?

160
00:13:28,759 --> 00:13:29,960
Gao Wenhao. You don't know him?

161
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:31,240
Never heard of Gao Wenhao?

162
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:32,159
Did you hear that?

163
00:13:32,720 --> 00:13:33,840
Gao Wenhao.

164
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:35,320
Gao Wenhao.

165
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:36,240
Gao Wenhao.

166
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:37,240
Gao Wenhao.

167
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:39,240
Gao Wenhao.

168
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:42,000
Gao Wenhao, Gao Wenhao.

169
00:13:42,200 --> 00:13:43,000
What's my name?

170
00:13:44,519 --> 00:13:45,960
Xu... Xu Hui.

171
00:13:46,360 --> 00:13:47,840
Why do you only know her?

172
00:13:48,639 --> 00:13:49,960
Oh my God.

173
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:51,960
She actually knows me.

174
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:53,600
You two are good friends.

175
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:55,000
This one. What's his name?

176
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,240
Liu Yang.

177
00:14:01,720 --> 00:14:03,039
Right, right. I'm sorry.

178
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,840
I was wrong. I was wrong.

179
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,080
I was wrong. I won't do it.

180
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:08,759
I won't. Please let me go.

181
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:11,360
I was wrong. I was wrong. I was wrong.

182
00:14:11,360 --> 00:14:13,720
I was wrong. I was wrong. I was wrong.

183
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:21,840
Old Zhou.

184
00:14:24,919 --> 00:14:26,799
Old Zhou, want to see your kid today?

185
00:14:28,639 --> 00:14:29,279
Hao.

186
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:30,840
The kids are in her hands.

187
00:14:37,840 --> 00:14:39,480
What the hell do you want?

188
00:14:42,919 --> 00:14:46,159
Just wanted to catch up with you all.

189
00:14:47,879 --> 00:14:49,000
Don't think holding the kids

190
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:50,240
means you can do whatever you want.

191
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:55,200
Actually,

192
00:14:56,600 --> 00:14:57,960
I really can.

193
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:01,919
How can you prove the kid is safe?

194
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:04,840
Live footage.

195
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:07,480
Everything you do here,

196
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:09,919
Xiaochen and Xiao Yu can see.

197
00:15:11,840 --> 00:15:12,879
A live broadcast.

198
00:15:20,240 --> 00:15:22,200
I must say, I'm impressed.

199
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:24,919
How so?

200
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:26,559
You spent all these years

201
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:29,039
planning revenge?

202
00:15:30,720 --> 00:15:31,360
That's right.

203
00:15:38,240 --> 00:15:39,519
Because you deserve it.
